---
// Hero — signature "designer." in filigrana
---
<section class="container-editorial relative overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <span
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none select-none absolute -left-1 -bottom-3 font-display italic font-light text-accent opacity-[0.055] leading-[0.85] tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap z-0"
    style="font-size: clamp(6rem, 22vw, 20rem); font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 100;"
  >designer.</span>

  <div class="relative z-10">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-5">Portfolio · [Città] · Aggiornato luglio 2026</p>
    <h1
      id="hero-title"
      class="font-display font-normal leading-[1.02] tracking-tight m-0 mb-5 max-w-[22ch]"
      style="font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw + 1rem, 6rem); font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 30;"
    >
      Progetto <em class="italic font-light text-accent">sistemi</em>, non schermate.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-step-1 leading-[1.5] text-muted max-w-[55ch] m-0">
      [Anni] anni tra prodotto e servizi digitali. Lavoro nel punto in cui la ricerca incontra le decisioni: framing dei problemi, sistemi di design, outcome misurabili. Sto spostando il mio focus verso ruoli di design strategy. Ultimo ruolo in [Azienda].
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 font-mono text-step--1 text-muted" aria-label="Disponibilità e settori">
      <span class="before:content-['◦_'] before:text-accent before:mr-1">Disponibile da settembre</span>
      <span class="before:content-['◦_'] before:text-accent before:mr-1">Fintech · SaaS B2B · Servizi</span>
      <span class="before:content-['◦_'] before:text-accent before:mr-1">Remoto o Milano</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
